// session-roam .stignore
// Place this file at ~/.claude/projects/.stignore
//
// KEEP: .jsonl session files, memory/ dirs, MEMORY.md, CLAUDE.md
// SKIP: worktrees, subagents, caches, temp files, build artifacts

// ─── Syncthing internals ──────────────────────────────────────
// Note: .stfolder and .stignore are auto-excluded by Syncthing.
// Do NOT add .stfolder here — Syncthing needs it as a folder marker.
.stversions

// ─── session-roam lock temp (atomic-write flicker, never sync) ─
*.roam-lock.tmp

// ─── Agent worktrees (GSD subagents, bulk of wasted sync) ─────
*worktrees*

// ─── Subagent session files (temp, not needed for resume) ─────
**/subagents

// ─── Webfetch cache (downloaded PDFs, HTML snapshots) ─────────
**/webfetch-*

// ─── Build artifacts and dependency caches ────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/*.pyc

// ─── Editor and OS junk ──────────────────────────────────────
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

// ─── Docker and container artifacts ───────────────────────────
**/.docker
**/docker-buildx

// ─── Browser data (Chrome extension cache) ────────────────────
**/chrome

// ─── Conflict files (investigate, don't sync) ─────────────────
// These indicate concurrent writes — see TROUBLESHOOTING.md
// Uncomment to auto-ignore (not recommended, better to investigate)
// **.sync-conflict-*
